cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MBSE4SDV, please cite it as below."
title: "MBSE4SDV: Model-Based Systems Engineering for Software-Defined Vehicles"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Instituto Tecnológico de Aragón (ITA)"
    website: "https://www.ita.es"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/ITA-TECNOLOGIA/webgme-mbse4sdv"
abstract: >-
  Collaborative, web-based Model-Based Systems Engineering (MBSE) workbench for traceable development of
  Software-Defined Vehicles, built on WebGME. It provides SDV lifecycle metamodels, custom visualisers and
  decorators, traceability and HFSM code generation plugins, a REST API and an MCP server.
  Developed in the CODE4EV project (EU grant agreement No 101192739).
keywords:
  - MBSE
  - software-defined vehicle
  - SysML
  - WebGME
  - traceability
  - MCP
